/td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"item-notes\"><b>Notes:</b><ol><li id=\"w-notes-1\">Theons were obtainable during Tibia's 25th Anniversary.</li><li id=\"w-notes-2\">For characters who collected 7,197 or more Theons during Tibia's 25th Anniversary.</li><li id=\"w-notes-3\">For characters who collected from 1,000 to 7,196 Theons during Tibia's 25th Anniversary.</li><li id=\"w-notes-4\">For characters who collected less than 1,000 Theons during Tibia's 25th Anniversary.</li></ol></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Theodora.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: hi<br/>\nTheodora: I can see you collected some Theons. I may have <b>something</b> for you.<br/>\nPlayer: something<br/>\nTheodora: Do you want this box filled with 24 festive items and a new anniversary backpack? I will trade it for 7197 Theons. ...<br/>\nTheodora: I also might have more items afterwards!<br/>\nPlayer: yes<br/>\nTheodora: There you go! If you want festive items, I'm happy to trade!<br/>\nPlayer: trade<br/>\nTheodora: Take a look at my <b>balloons</b>, <b>carpets</b>, <b>food</b>, <b>fun</b> and <b>decorations</b>!\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Theodora</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":[],"pos":{"x":32332,"y":32183,"z":7}}